{"id":"glu_ck","lemma":"Glück","pos":"noun","rank":250,"glosses":["happiness, joy, bliss (state or emotion)","luck, success (mostly when seen as dependant on unearned, accidental factors)","good luck, chance (positive coincidence)"],"ipa":"/ɡlʏk/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a7/De-Gl%C3%BCck.ogg/De-Gl%C3%BCck.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Glückes"},"formAudio":{"Glückes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d2/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Gl%C3%BCckes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Kann man mit Geld Glück kaufen?","en":"Can money buy happiness?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759695","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"one"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"money"},null,{"g":"to buy, to purchase"}]},{"text":"Weißt du, was Glück ist?","en":"Do you know what happiness is?","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Ich wünsche dir Glück.","en":"I wish you luck.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/67804","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to wish for","l":"wünschen"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},null]},{"text":"Ich werde mein Glück versuchen.","en":"I'll try my luck.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/391547","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"to try, to attempt"}]},{"text":"Hattest du heute Glück?","en":"Did you have any luck today?","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"today"},null]}]}